          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "Jer. 27:6 (4–11); John 19:11; Rom. 13:1 (1–4); D&C 98:5 (4–7); 101:77; A of F 1:12. TG Citizenship; Governments."
          },
          {
